{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847150/extras/8a093e03a8dca09d303afac7f5d202f3.avif?t=1759936359\" width=480 height=426 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arise</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charlie has fallen into a surreal realm shaped by his memories, fears, and emotions. His only chance of awaking lies in traversing these dreams to their bitter end.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dart between cryptic environments as you solve puzzles, interact with environs, and try &amp; solve the mystery behind what happened to you in the conscious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grisly atmosphere of nightmarish critters await you around every bend, immersing you in the dense ambience of this somnolent terror.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3847150?t=1759936359","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847150/2ee68e7f94aed93635721e56c17664607cbc6d15/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759936359","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847150/d05993e3afc51d4add46788d8c824a18c4037101/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759936359","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3847150/d05993e3afc51d4add46788d8c824a18c4037101/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759936359","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"conten